# Optional: Supabase backend for the real "you beat X% of players today" ranking.
#
# When BOTH are set, Spectra submits your score to Supabase and shows the live
# distribution of everyone's scores today. When either is missing or the request
# fails, the game falls back to a built-in offline estimate and stays fully
# playable with no backend at all.
#
# Find these in your Supabase project: Settings → API.
# The anon key is safe to expose publicly — the database is locked down with RLS
# and only the two SECURITY DEFINER functions (see supabase/schema.sql) are callable.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
